{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You wake up in the courtyard of an abandoned old castle.<br>The villagers? All dead.<br>The silence? Deafening.<br>Your team? Disoriented, poorly equipped, and probably on the verge of panic.<br>Welcome to <strong>NightMaze</strong>, a co-op game where dark humor meets medieval horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore the halls of a twisted fortress, uncover the secrets of a forgotten curse, grab whatever loot you can\u2026 and escape into a monster-infested maze.<br>But be warned: your screams might drown out your laughter.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Co-op mystery-solving</strong> \u2013 Unravel the secrets of the castle together.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udddf <strong>Living labyrinth</strong> \u2013 Monsters, traps, and paths that shift when you least expect.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f <strong>Loot &amp; survive</strong> \u2013 Gear up smart\u2026 or die trying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\ude02 <strong>Scary-funny chaos</strong> \u2013 Designed to scare you and make you laugh</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join this discord and give me your feedback !!<br></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3744640?t=1750955898","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744640/0e76985850681370e99f96b770efd8f2b7101991/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750955898","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744640/07704ebce2fac886e715aff0aa6e503ddfe9b060/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750955898","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3744640/07704ebce2fac886e715aff0aa6e503ddfe9b060/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750955898","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"des